WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:01.160
Okay, as I said,

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.460
next week we're gonna
start our final two weeks

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:07.480
of the nightly show with live audiences.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.730
We're very excited about that,

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:12.290
but it does mean we're
gonna be saying farewell

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:15.590
to the cardboard cutouts
that we've been using.

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:17.300
About a year ago,

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.590
we asked fans to send
in photos of themselves.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:23.200
They did, and they have
been our audience now,

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.370
in the Largo Theater, for about a year.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.177
Some of you are probably wondering,

00:00:27.177 --> 00:00:29.580
"What's going to happen to these cutouts?"

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.830
Well, guess what?

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:34.490
We happen to know exactly
what's gonna happen to them.

00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:35.635
Take a look.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:39.052
(gentle uplifting music)

